  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Expanding civic space through active CSO participation and strengthened governance system in Bangladesh</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The action aims to strengthen local Civil Society Organisations&#xbf; ability to engage as actors of good governance and development at country level in Bangladesh through financial support to third parties. The Action will improve the situation by- tackling marginalisation and discrimination through support to CSOs representing minority communities, such as disabled people&apos;s organisations, organisations representing other minority groups and CSOs.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
